#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:28
msgid "Membership on this site comes from your customer account at our Shopify store. When you sign in with it, we keep a copy of a few account details on your account here: your Shopify customer ID, name and email address, the tags that decide your membership, your account status, your email and SMS marketing choices, a purchase summary (number of orders and amount spent), and the dates your membership started and renews. Shopify stays the record of your account; this copy is updated whenever Shopify reports a change, and is used only to decide what you can read here."
