#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:33
msgid "Cookies: redeemid_oauth_state (for ten minutes while you sign in), redeemid_cart and redeemid_cart_count (your cart, for up to 14 days), and redeemid_fset (which membership features you hold, so pages can be cached correctly; removed when you close your browser)."
